B.atF=s(["We live under the sand. Day burns, night freezes.","Someone from across the water? That is rare.","The bench is yours. Use it, leave it in one piece.","The way east is shut for now. The lamps stay lit."],t.s)
B.aP_=new A.e9("hollow_elder","Elder Sahra","hollow",14,5,90,B.atF,null,null,null,null,!1,!1,!1,!1,B.KG,"mage",null,null,null,null)
B.aFz=s(["Sit. The sand does its damage slowly, and I am patient.","Talk to me before you go back out. I will keep your place.","Water first. The road east can wait."],t.s)
B.aOW=new A.e9("hollow_healer","Healer Idris","hollow",21,5,90,B.aFz,null,null,null,null,!1,!1,!1,!0,B.Kl,"priest",null,null,null,null)
B.auw=s(["Same stock as Neva, same fair prices.","Have a look. The lamps are free."],t.s)
