B.arD=s(["Two ways: the long dry rim, or the stones over the brine.","I work the rim. Saltwort mostly, and cobalt off the islands.","Bring me a haul and I will tell you what I know."],t.s)
B.aKB=new A.F(B.lO,["Salt Gatherer Yusra","female","female","olive","brown","xlong","dark_brown","longsleeve","white","pants","tan","shoes","brown"],t.l)
